[[1,398165,0,6,0,6,"2015-06-21T19:20:18","sudo_intellectual","",[],"<p>Wow, Australia. You really have no idea what you're doing, eh? You know....we have this thing...the internet. On the internet you can get whatever you want, banned or not. Banning digital things is kind of like shooting a hose in the air and trying to catch all the water in your palm.</p>"],[1,399143,0,3,0,3,"2015-06-21T20:36:10","Alpha_Machine","",[],"<blockquote>\n<p>Measure Bra Size Prank</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>Game of the year right here.</p>"],[1,399241,0,4,0,4,"2015-06-21T20:43:00","HoloTheWiseWolf","",[],"<p>In other news, water is still, in fact, wet.</p>"],[2,399762,399241,0,0,0,"2015-06-21T21:24:03","LiteraryHitler","",[],"<p>Then how do you explain this dry white wine!? </p>"],[2,400459,399241,0,0,0,"2015-06-21T22:19:36","destinthegreat","",[],"<p><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dry_water\">Dry Water</a></p>"],[3,400870,400459,0,0,0,"2015-06-21T22:54:40","HoloTheWiseWolf","",[],"<p>Yeah, but the water in it is wet.</p>"],[1,409554,0,1,0,1,"2015-06-22T11:36:24","ZappyKins","",[],"<p>Is that because they don't want anyone being distracted from the venomous insects and drop bears?</p>"],[1,410600,0,1,0,1,"2015-06-22T14:02:20","DNZe","",[],"<p>Its always about saving the kids, right?</p>"]]
